[ti:Toota Ghada]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Folk & Regional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ek chilam, ek baabaa, do ghade ka khel...
[00:19.21]Aaj maine ajab tamaashaa dekha
[00:30.43]Ek baabaa aur do ghade sang khel
[00:41.64]Toota ghada roya, aansu bahaaya
[00:52.85]Haye re mere baabaa, teri mehnat bekaar jaaye
[01:04.06]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[01:15.28]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[01:26.49]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[01:37.70]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[01:48.91]Main andha tha, ab aankhe khuli
[02:00.13]Mera chhed hi mera geet ban gaya
[02:11.34]Toota ghada gaaye, baabaa muskaaye
[02:22.55]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[02:33.76]Aaj nahi to kal wapas
[02:44.98]Nahi akaarth koi karm...
[02:56.19]Kal wapas...
